@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

title Systemd Adapter - C4 Context

actor "Operator" as operator
rectangle "Pulumi Stage A\n(controlplane)" as pulumi
rectangle "Systemd Adapter\n(Spring Boot service)" as adapter
rectangle "systemd manager\n(org.freedesktop.systemd1)" as systemd
rectangle "Seed node runtime" as seed

operator --> pulumi : run preview/up
pulumi --> adapter : reads /status/systemd\nreads /healthz/systemd
adapter --> systemd : queries unit/job state
systemd --> seed : orchestrates units/targets
operator --> adapter : direct health checks\nfor debugging
@enduml
